    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go\"... that sounds almost beautiful. like a way to stop the struggle. but i don't know if i just mean letting go of my ego. sometimes i think i mean letting go of everything. just... fading out completely so the noise finally stops. is that even a thing? just peacefully exiting when your time has naturally passed?",
